    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just physical... it's like my soul is just done. i don't even think \"self-compassion\" can fix this. it feels like i've reached a point where there's nothing left to give, and no amount of sleep or \"rest\" is ever going to make this feeling go away. it's just this permanent, crushing emptiness.",
